    "summary": "SPF 30 is sufficient for most everyday sun protection needs, as the difference between SPF 30 (97% UVB blockage) and higher numbers like SPF 100 (99%) is marginal; proper application and reapplication, along with broad-spectrum coverage, matter far more than chasing a higher SPF rating.",
